<template><section class="health"><button class="back" @click="$router.push('/home')">← 返回首页</button><template v-if="!current"><h1>自我测评与健康评估</h1><p>选择主题，回答问题，查看针对回答整理的行动建议。</p><div class="tools"><button v-for="(item,i) in assessments" :key="item.id" @click="open(item)"><img :src="'/img/assess'+(i+1)+'.png'" alt=""><strong>{{item.title}}</strong><span>{{item.subtitle}} →</span></button></div></template><template v-else><button class="back" @click="current=null;result=null">← 返回评估列表</button><h1>{{current.title}}</h1><p>{{current.intro}} 回答仅在当前页面使用，不会保存。</p><form @submit.prevent="submit"><fieldset v-for="(question,i) in current.questions" :key="question.id"><legend>{{i+1}}. {{question.text}}</legend><label v-for="option in question.options" :key="option"><input v-model="answers[question.id]" type="radio" :name="question.id" :value="option" @change="result=null" required>{{option}}</label></fieldset><button class="primary">生成健康建议</button></form><div v-if="result" class="result-card" role="status"><h2>根据您的回答</h2><span class="priority" :class="{urgent:result.level==='立即就医'||result.level==='立即寻求帮助'}">{{result.level}}</span><p>{{result.intro}}</p><h3>建议采取的行动</h3><ul><li v-for="action in result.actions" :key="action">{{action}}</li></ul><h3>本次回答</h3><ul><li v-for="question in current.questions" :key="question.id">{{question.text}} {{answers[question.id]}}</li></ul><p>本问卷用于整理健康信息，不能作为疾病诊断；出现严重或令人担忧的症状时，请及时寻求医疗帮助。</p><a :href="current.source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看参考资料 ↗</a></div></template></section></template>
<script setup>
import {ref} from 'vue'
import {assessments,buildAdvice} from '../data/assessments'
const current=ref(null),answers=ref({}),result=ref(null)
function submit(){result.value=buildAdvice(current.value.id,answers.value)}
function open(a){current.value=a;answers.value={};result.value=null}
</script>
<style scoped>.health>p,.health>template>p{color:#78938b;line-height:1.8;margin:15px 0}.tools{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:25px}.tools button{border:1px solid #e3eeeb;background:white;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;text-align:left;padding:0 0 16px;color:#204b43}.tools img{width:100%;height:135px;object-fit:cover}.tools strong,.tools span{display:block;margin:12px 16px 0}.tools span{color:#138c75;font-size:12px}.health form,.result-card{max-width:800px;background:white;border:1px solid #e3eeeb;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin-top:20px}.health fieldset{border:0;border-bottom:1px solid #edf3f0;padding:12px 0 20px;margin:0 0 18px}.health legend{font-weight:700}.health label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;margin:15px 25px 0 0}.health label input{width:auto}.priority{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:20px;background:#e7f6ee;color:#147b63}.priority.urgent{background:#fff0ed;color:#b44435}.result-card h3{margin-top:18px}.result-card p,.result-card li{color:#57766d;line-height:1.8;margin-top:12px}.result-card a{display:inline-block;margin-top:15px;color:#138c75}@media(max-width:700px){.tools{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.tools img{height:95px}}</style>